{"nodes": [{"id": "graphify_out_memory_query_20260725_214440_what_forces_d_state_128_across_the_presets__and_wh_query", "label": "Memory: What Forces d_state=128 Across the Presets", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "graphify-out/memory/query_20260725_214440_what_forces_d_state_128_across_the_presets__and_wh.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-07-25T21:44:40.213239+00:00", "author": null, "contributor": "graphify", "rationale": "Query memo recording a graph traversal. The graphify query CLI collapsed to 4 nodes because it matched the torch 'Size' label, so traversal was done inline with explicit start nodes; outcome signalled useful."}, {"id": "graphify_out_memory_query_20260725_214440_what_forces_d_state_128_across_the_presets__and_wh_mamba3_hybrid_like", "label": "mamba3_hybrid_like()", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "graphify-out/memory/query_20260725_214440_what_forces_d_state_128_across_the_presets__and_wh.md", "source_location": "config.py:164", "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-07-25T21:44:40.213239+00:00", "author": null, "contributor": "graphify", "rationale": "The single funnel that declares d_state=128 (config.py:176). Nothing forces 128 architecturally - it is an overridable default, and config.py:293/312 state this explicitly."}, {"id": "graphify_out_memory_query_20260725_214440_what_forces_d_state_128_across_the_presets__and_wh_mamba3_hybrid_190m", "label": "mamba3_hybrid_190M Preset", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "graphify-out/memory/query_20260725_214440_what_forces_d_state_128_across_the_presets__and_wh.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-07-25T21:44:40.213239+00:00", "author": null, "contributor": "graphify", "rationale": "Calls mamba3_hybrid_like() and re-declares d_state=128 in its own signature rather than inheriting it silently."}, {"id": "graphify_out_memory_query_20260725_214440_what_forces_d_state_128_across_the_presets__and_wh_mamba3_hybrid_1b", "label": "mamba3_hybrid_1B Preset", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "graphify-out/memory/query_20260725_214440_what_forces_d_state_128_across_the_presets__and_wh.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-07-25T21:44:40.213239+00:00", "author": null, "contributor": "graphify", "rationale": "Calls mamba3_hybrid_like() and re-declares d_state=128 in its own signature."}, {"id": "graphify_out_memory_query_20260725_214440_what_forces_d_state_128_across_the_presets__and_wh_mamba3_olmo3_370m", "label": "mamba3_olmo3_370M Preset", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "graphify-out/memory/query_20260725_214440_what_forces_d_state_128_across_the_presets__and_wh.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-07-25T21:44:40.213239+00:00", "author": null, "contributor": "graphify", "rationale": "Calls mamba3_hybrid_like() and re-declares d_state=128; it is the preset whose parameter match and single-variable ablation constraints are broken by moving to d_state=96."}, {"id": "graphify_out_memory_query_20260725_214440_what_forces_d_state_128_across_the_presets__and_wh_build_a5_model", "label": "build_a5_model() A5 Harness Builder", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "graphify-out/memory/query_20260725_214440_what_forces_d_state_128_across_the_presets__and_wh.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-07-25T21:44:40.213239+00:00", "author": null, "contributor": "graphify", "rationale": "Calls mamba3_hybrid_like() but already dodges the divisibility problem by hardcoding d_state=48, which divides evenly by 2, 3, 4, 6 and 8."}, {"id": "graphify_out_memory_query_20260725_214440_what_forces_d_state_128_across_the_presets__and_wh__validate_dims", "label": "_validate_dims()", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "graphify-out/memory/query_20260725_214440_what_forces_d_state_128_across_the_presets__and_wh.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-07-25T21:44:40.213239+00:00", "author": null, "contributor": "graphify", "rationale": "Listed as a traversal source node for the d_state divisibility question; it is the dimension validator implicated in the loud failure when d_state is indivisible by rotation_block_size."}, {"id": "graphify_out_memory_query_20260725_214440_what_forces_d_state_128_across_the_presets__and_wh_test_mamba3_olmo3_370m_default_d_state_cannot_express_block_size_3", "label": "test_mamba3_olmo3_370M_default_d_state_cannot_express_block_size_3", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "graphify-out/memory/query_20260725_214440_what_forces_d_state_128_across_the_presets__and_wh.md", "source_location": "model_test.py:179", "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-07-25T21:44:40.213239+00:00", "author": null, "contributor": "graphify", "rationale": "Pins that rotation_block_size=3 at the default d_state fails loudly rather than silently degrading; the companion assertion at model_test.py:257 confirms d_state=96 with rotation_block_size=3 does build, so 96 is a supported, tested path."}, {"id": "graphify_out_memory_query_20260725_214440_what_forces_d_state_128_across_the_presets__and_wh_test_mamba3_olmo3_370m_is_parameter_matched", "label": "test_mamba3_olmo3_370M_is_parameter_matched", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "graphify-out/memory/query_20260725_214440_what_forces_d_state_128_across_the_presets__and_wh.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-07-25T21:44:40.213239+00:00", "author": null, "contributor": "graphify", "rationale": "Breaks if the NC1 ablation drops to d_state=96, because in_B/in_C shrink 25 percent. What d_state=96 breaks is the experimental design, not the model."}, {"id": "graphify_out_memory_query_20260725_214440_what_forces_d_state_128_across_the_presets__and_wh_test_mamba3_olmo3_370m_switches_block_size_without_touching_anything_else", "label": "test_mamba3_olmo3_370M_switches_block_size_without_touching_anything_else", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "graphify-out/memory/query_20260725_214440_what_forces_d_state_128_across_the_presets__and_wh.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-07-25T21:44:40.213239+00:00", "author": null, "contributor": "graphify", "rationale": "Encodes the single-variable ablation invariant: 'Flipping rotation_block_size must be the only difference between the arms'. Changing d_state alongside the block size violates it."}, {"id": "graphify_out_memory_query_20260725_214440_what_forces_d_state_128_across_the_presets__and_wh_d_state", "label": "d_state Overridable Default", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "graphify-out/memory/query_20260725_214440_what_forces_d_state_128_across_the_presets__and_wh.md", "source_location": "config.py:176", "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-07-25T21:44:40.213239+00:00", "author": null, "contributor": "graphify", "rationale": "d_state=128 is declared once in mamba3_hybrid_like and re-declared per preset, but nothing architectural forces it; config.py:293/312 explicitly document it as overridable. Its value matters because it must be divisible by rotation_block_size and because it scales the B/C projection width."}, {"id": "graphify_out_memory_query_20260725_214440_what_forces_d_state_128_across_the_presets__and_wh_rotation_block_size", "label": "rotation_block_size", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "graphify-out/memory/query_20260725_214440_what_forces_d_state_128_across_the_presets__and_wh.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-07-25T21:44:40.213239+00:00", "author": null, "contributor": "graphify", "rationale": "The block size b of the non-abelian rotation. b=3 requires a d_state divisible by 3, which the power-of-two default cannot provide; b=3 trainability is one leg of the three-way tension."}, {"id": "graphify_out_memory_query_20260725_214440_what_forces_d_state_128_across_the_presets__and_wh_bc_out", "label": "bc_out = n_groups * mimo_rank * d_state", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "graphify-out/memory/query_20260725_214440_what_forces_d_state_128_across_the_presets__and_wh.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-07-25T21:44:40.213239+00:00", "author": null, "contributor": "graphify", "rationale": "The width formula that couples d_state to parameter count: dropping d_state from 128 to 96 shrinks in_B/in_C by 25 percent, which is why a d_state change is never parameter-neutral."}, {"id": "graphify_out_memory_query_20260725_214440_what_forces_d_state_128_across_the_presets__and_wh_three_way_tension", "label": "Three-Way Tension: Parameter Match, Single-Variable Ablation, b=3 Trainability", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "graphify-out/memory/query_20260725_214440_what_forces_d_state_128_across_the_presets__and_wh.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-07-25T21:44:40.213239+00:00", "author": null, "contributor": "graphify", "rationale": "OLMo-3 parameter matching, single-variable ablation, and b=3 trainability form a pick-two constraint: satisfying b=3 requires a divisible d_state, which moves parameter count and adds a second variable to the ablation arm."}, {"id": "graphify_out_memory_query_20260725_214440_what_forces_d_state_128_across_the_presets__and_wh_nc1_ablation", "label": "NC1 Ablation Arm", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "graphify-out/memory/query_20260725_214440_what_forces_d_state_128_across_the_presets__and_wh.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-07-25T21:44:40.213239+00:00", "author": null, "contributor": "graphify", "rationale": "The non-abelian arm whose hypothetical switch to d_state=96 motivated the query; the model would build fine, but the experimental design guarantees would not survive."}], "edges": [{"source": "graphify_out_memory_query_20260725_214440_what_forces_d_state_128_across_the_presets__and_wh_query", "target": "graphify_out_memory_query_20260725_214440_what_forces_d_state_128_across_the_presets__an